            </titleStmt>
            <physDesc xml:id="physDesc_N2031F">
               <titlePage label="Title page" xml:id="titlePage_204N200C1">
                  <p xml:id="idm58">Ved Axel Liebmanns Kiste / af / I.P.E. Hartmann</p>
               </titlePage>
               <extent xml:id="extent_N20325">4 pages</extent>
               <dimensions unit="cm" xml:id="dimensions_N20328">34.5 x 26</dimensions>
               <physMedium xml:id="physMedium_N2032B">Written in brown ink. Paper: 12 staves. At beginning of the music the copyist originally wrote: "Tenori Bassi". This has been corrected by Hartmann to "Sopran, Alt Tenor". At the end of the music on p. 3 in Hartmann's hand: "Det originale / Manuscript foræret / Fru Nanna Liebmann / Febr. 1876."</physMedium>
